{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The lag-bolt assortment fits my ongoing fastening projects and adds heavier wood-fastening options alongside my machine screws and rivet nuts.",
    "Duct tape, magnetic hooks, and carbide burrs address practical repair, tool-storage, and finishing tasks that connect naturally with my recent workshop purchases."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The anatomy model has no connection to the making and repair tasks reflected in my history; I have no current teaching or anatomy need.",
    "The pressure gauge needs a specific application, pressure range, and fitting that my history does not establish. Fixed-size screws and bolts are relevant, but I still need the right dimensions before choosing them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My interest in workshop supplies seems to have been stretched into interest in specialized equipment without a clear project connecting it to my needs.",
    "My repeated fastener purchases seem to have been treated as interest in any fastener, although thread, length, material, and intended use determine whether another pack is useful."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated assortment purchases suggest that having useful size options matters; a single-size pack needs a more specific project match.",
    "Equipment compatibility and immediate purpose matter: burrs need a suitable tool, magnetic hooks need steel, and a vacuum chamber would need to suit my resin and project demands."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my workshop and fastening interests, but sometimes mistake a broad connection for a specific, usable next purchase."
}"}
